# (++Fortnite+Release-43.12-CL-60598086) refuses it at each occurrence,
# error 3655, "Identifier is too long" (followup-book2/long-ident-1025; the
# Book's tests, Bugs/FORT-555217-VeryLongIdentifier.versetest 5, 11, 37).
long_field := class:
    XVar_____:int = 42
Main():void = Print("{long_field{}.XVar_____}")
